Slide 2 – Introduction & Problem Statement

Introduction

Banking operations generate large volumes of transactional, customer and account data. Analysing this data helps monitor activity, identify risks and evaluate financial exposure.

Problem Statement

Fragmented banking datasets make it difficult to obtain a consolidated view of transaction activity, risk patterns and branch-level exposure.

Our Approach: Integrate and analyse banking data through interactive BI dashboards.

